  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I find it would be highly helpful if the routes for default parameters like velocity, angular, voice, ect. were separated from custom expresion menu parameters from the user on the autogenerated osc file.\nSomething like making the default path for default parameters /avatar/parameters/default/name and the user parameters like /avatar/parameters/custom/name.\nIntended to make debugging easier and find the name of parameter you are changing in the expression menu by listening to the custom parameters path value changes.\nThis behaviour would be useful in cases where, for example, the original avatar files have been lost or when using OSC features on a public avatar. With this change one could simply listen to the custom path, having the OSC interface display just the custom user parameters.",
